Implemented `--group-by-category` with filtering before grouping, category sorting, summed quantities, and exact decimal stock values formatted as two-digit JSON strings.

Ungrouped output is preserved. Invalid CSV returns exit code 2 with stderr and no traceback. Processing remains separate from argument parsing. README includes a grouped example and expected output.

All 10 tests passed with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`. Supplied tests were unchanged.
